==============================================================================
A10.2  where the Bayes score gets its certainty
==============================================================================
  rows with more distinct values than the 4 option slots: 0.1065
    those are LOGICALLY certain REVISED. Among them, actual REVISED fraction 1.0000
    (it must be 1.0; anything else means the likelihood is wrong)

  excluding them, Bayes AUROC on the remaining 19763 rows 0.9337
  so the ceiling is not carried only by the logically-certain rows.
